From 6f320ddcdd2316ccb57937a41d4338863503de32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Belfry <belfry@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:11:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] chore(brand): Belfry branding instead of Divine

Product name Belfry in the API (e-mail subjects and bodies, claim pages, default sender)
and the web app (brand constants, title, manifest, logo and favicon as SVG, landing page
copy, bunker modal, support admin). Belfry navy replaces Divine green as the primary colour
(CSS variable names kept). Divine's PNG icons and logo, the ATProto/Bluesky settings card and
the Divine demo page are removed. Internal names (vine_id, --color-divine-* variables) stay.
